#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:2
msgid "Deploy for Enterprise to Edge DDIL Operations"
msgstr "엔터프라이즈-엣지 DDIL 운영을 위한 배포"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:5
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "개요"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:7
msgid ""
"Disconnected, Denied, Intermittent, and Limited (DDIL) network conditions"
" present unique challenges for enterprise-to-edge operations. Field "
"operations, remote deployments, and edge environments often become "
"temporarily isolated from the internet, interrupting direct access to "
"Microsoft 365 services such as Teams and Outlook."
msgstr ""
"단절·거부·간헐·제한(DDIL) 네트워크 조건은 엔터프라이즈-엣지 운영에 고유한 "
"과제를 제기합니다. 현장 작전, 원격 배포, 엣지 환경은 종종 일시적으로 인터넷에서 "
"격리되어 Teams, Outlook 같은 Microsoft 365 서비스에 대한 직접 접근이 "
"중단됩니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:9
msgid ""
"Mattermost enables resilient collaboration by remaining fully operational"
" in DDIL environments. Mission users continue to access self-hosted "
"messaging collaboration, workflow automation, and mission planning within"
" their mobile tactical network. No internet connectivity is required for "
"enhanced collaboration functions, including mission tuned AI agents "
"powered by self-hosted LLMs, and audio and screen sharing services."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST는 DDIL 환경에서도 완전히 작동하여 복원력 있는 협업을 가능하게 합니다. "
"임무 사용자는 모바일 전술 네트워크 내에서 셀프 호스팅 메시지 협업, 워크플로 "
"자동화, 임무 계획에 계속 접근할 수 있습니다. 셀프 호스팅 LLM으로 구동되는 "
"임무 맞춤형 AI 에이전트와 오디오 및 화면 공유 서비스를 포함한 향상된 협업 "
"기능에는 인터넷 연결이 필요하지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:11
msgid ""
"When connectivity is restored, mission users regain access to M365 "
"enterprise systems in addition to collaboration continuity with "
"enterprise users through the :doc:`embedded Mattermost experience "
"</integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365>` inside "
"their Microsoft Teams and Outlook applications. All mission activity "
"during the period of disconnection becomes available across enterprise "
"and tactical environments when connectivity returns."
msgstr ""
"연결이 복구되면 임무 사용자는 Microsoft Teams 및 Outlook 애플리케이션 내의 "
":doc:`내장 OKR.BEST 환경 </integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-"
"for-m365>`\\ 을 통해 엔터프라이즈 사용자와의 협업 연속성과 함께 M365 "
"엔터프라이즈 시스템에 대한 접근을 다시 확보합니다. 연결이 끊겼던 기간의 모든 "
"임무 활동은 연결이 복구되면 엔터프라이즈 및 전술 환경 전반에서 사용할 수 있게 "
"됩니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:13
msgid ""
"Traditional cloud-only solutions fail in these scenarios, while fully "
"disconnected systems don't integrate with enterprise tools during normal "
"operations. This deployment architecture :doc:`extends sovereign "
"collaboration with Microsoft Teams and Outlook </deployment-guide"
"/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-"
"collaboration>` to the tactical edge, providing a hybrid solution that "
"enables enterprise integration and fully disconnected tactical "
"collaboration."
msgstr ""
"전통적인 클라우드 전용 솔루션은 이러한 시나리오에서 실패하는 반면, 완전히 "
"단절된 시스템은 정상 운영 중에 엔터프라이즈 도구와 통합되지 않습니다. 이 배포 "
"아키텍처는 :doc:`Microsoft Teams 및 Outlook과의 주권적 협업 </deployment-guide"
"/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-"
"collaboration>`\\ 을 전술 엣지로 확장하여, 엔터프라이즈 통합과 완전히 단절된 "
"전술 협업을 모두 가능하게 하는 하이브리드 솔루션을 제공합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:15
msgid ""
"Mattermost diagram displays the deployment components and relationships "
"outlined in detail in this document."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST 다이어그램은 이 문서에서 자세히 설명하는 배포 구성 요소와 관계를 "
"보여줍니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:19
msgid ""
"Consider `talking to a Mattermost expert <https://mattermost.com/contact-"
"sales/>`__ if your organization needs support deploying Mattermost and "
"supporting services for DDIL operations."
msgstr ""
"조직이 DDIL 운영을 위해 OKR.BEST 및 지원 서비스를 배포하는 데 도움이 필요하다면 "
"`Mattermost 전문가와 상담 <https://mattermost.com/contact-sales/>`__\\ 하는 "
"것을 고려하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:22
msgid "Architecture components"
msgstr "아키텍처 구성 요소"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:24
msgid ""
"This hybrid deployment architecture provides optimal collaboration in "
"both connected and disconnected states, including:"
msgstr ""
"이 하이브리드 배포 아키텍처는 연결된 상태와 단절된 상태 모두에서 최적의 협업을 "
"제공하며, 다음을 포함합니다:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:26
msgid ""
"**Enterprise Network:** Network containing enterprise services and "
"continuous access to Microsoft 365. The network may have a firewall or "
"access gateway protecting egress and ingress, such as network policies, "
"IP allowlists, or WAFs depending on your networking configurations."
msgstr ""
"**엔터프라이즈 네트워크:** 엔터프라이즈 서비스와 Microsoft 365에 대한 지속적인 "
"접근을 포함하는 네트워크입니다. 네트워킹 구성에 따라 네트워크 정책, IP 허용 "
"목록, WAF 등 이그레스와 인그레스를 보호하는 방화벽이나 접근 게이트웨이를 가질 수 "
"있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:28
msgid ""
"**Enterprise Users:** Users within the enterprise network boundary "
"accessing client applications for M365 services and Mattermost."
msgstr ""
"**엔터프라이즈 사용자:** M365 서비스 및 OKR.BEST용 클라이언트 애플리케이션에 "
"접근하는 엔터프라이즈 네트워크 경계 내의 사용자입니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:30
msgid ""
"**Tactical Network:** Operates independently during internet "
"disconnections, hosting a self-contained Mattermost deployment to ensure "
"mission users maintain collaboration capabilities."
msgstr ""
"**전술 네트워크:** 인터넷 단절 중에도 독립적으로 작동하며, 자체 완결형 OKR.BEST "
"배포를 호스팅하여 임무 사용자가 협업 역량을 유지하도록 보장합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:32
msgid ""
"**Mission Users:** Tactical or edge users who may be intermittently "
"disconnected from enterprise systems and Microsoft services."
msgstr ""
"**임무 사용자:** 엔터프라이즈 시스템 및 Microsoft 서비스에서 간헐적으로 단절될 "
"수 있는 전술 또는 엣지 사용자입니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:34
msgid "**Identity Providers:**"
msgstr "**ID 공급자:**"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:36
msgid ""
"**Microsoft Entra ID:** Enterprise users authenticate to M365 "
"applications and Mattermost using :doc:`single sign-on Entra ID "
"</administration-guide/onboard/sso-entraid>` via OpenID Connect (OIDC) or"
" SAML. This provider only works with functioning internet access."
msgstr ""
"**Microsoft Entra ID:** 엔터프라이즈 사용자는 OpenID Connect(OIDC) 또는 SAML을 "
"통해 :doc:`Entra ID 싱글 사인온 </administration-guide/onboard/sso-entraid>`\\ "
"을 사용하여 M365 애플리케이션과 OKR.BEST에 인증합니다. 이 공급자는 인터넷 "
"접근이 정상일 때만 작동합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:38
msgid ""
"**Alternative Local Identity Provider:** Deployed within the tactical "
"network to provide authentication services for mission users during "
"disconnected periods when M365 is unreachable. The local IdP serves as "
"the primary authentication source for Mattermost and maintains an "
"independent user directory that operates without internet connectivity."
msgstr ""
"**대체 로컬 ID 공급자:** M365에 연결할 수 없는 단절 기간 동안 임무 사용자에게 "
"인증 서비스를 제공하기 위해 전술 네트워크 내에 배포됩니다. 로컬 IdP는 "
"OKR.BEST의 기본 인증 소스 역할을 하며, 인터넷 연결 없이 작동하는 독립적인 사용자 "
"디렉토리를 유지합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:40
msgid "**Client Applications:**"
msgstr "**클라이언트 애플리케이션:**"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:42
msgid ""
"**Microsoft 365 Desktop Apps:** Teams and Outlook with :doc:`embedded "
"Mattermost application. </integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-"
"collaboration-for-m365>`"
msgstr ""
"**Microsoft 365 데스크톱 앱:** :doc:`내장 OKR.BEST 애플리케이션 </integrations-"
"guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365>`\\ 을 갖춘 Teams 및 "
"Outlook입니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:44
msgid ""
"When internet connected: Enables seamless enterprise-to-edge "
"collaboration within a familiar interface."
msgstr ""
"인터넷 연결 시: 익숙한 인터페이스 내에서 매끄러운 엔터프라이즈-엣지 협업을 "
"가능하게 합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:46
msgid ""
"When internet disconnected: Microsoft services are unreachable, but "
"embedded Mattermost application remains fully operational for tactical "
"teams."
msgstr ""
"인터넷 단절 시: Microsoft 서비스에는 연결할 수 없지만, 내장 OKR.BEST "
"애플리케이션은 전술 팀을 위해 완전히 작동합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:48
msgid ""
"**Mattermost Desktop Apps:** Access Mattermost via :doc:`desktop "
"</deployment-guide/desktop/desktop-app-deployment>` or web apps in "
"addition to the embedded views from Teams and Outlook. *(Optional - not "
"shown)*"
msgstr ""
"**OKR.BEST 데스크톱 앱:** Teams 및 Outlook의 내장 뷰 외에도 :doc:`데스크톱 "
"</deployment-guide/desktop/desktop-app-deployment>` 또는 웹 앱을 통해 "
"OKR.BEST에 접근합니다. *(선택 사항 - 표시되지 않음)*"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:50
msgid ""
"**Mattermost Mobile Apps:** Access Mattermost via :doc:`iPhone and "
"Android apps </deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-app-deployment>`, with "
"support for :doc:`ID-only push notifications </deployment-guide/mobile"
"/host-your-own-push-proxy-service>` to ensure compliance with data "
"sovereignty requirements. *(Optional when connectivity permits - not "
"shown)*"
msgstr ""
"**OKR.BEST 모바일 앱:** :doc:`iPhone 및 Android 앱 </deployment-guide/mobile"
"/mobile-app-deployment>`\\ 을 통해 OKR.BEST에 접근하며, 데이터 주권 요구 사항 "
"준수를 보장하기 위해 :doc:`ID 전용 푸시 알림 </deployment-guide/mobile/host-"
"your-own-push-proxy-service>`\\ 을 지원합니다. *(연결이 허용될 때 선택 사항 - "
"표시되지 않음)*"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:52
msgid ""
"**Mattermost Deployment:** Mattermost deployed for sovereign tactical "
"collaboration on local infrastructure, such as `Azure Local "
"<https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/azure-local/manage/disconnected-"
"operations-overview>`_, supporting data residency regulations and "
":doc:`disconnected operations </deployment-guide/reference-architecture"
"/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment>`. See :doc:`reference "
"architecture </administration-guide/scale/server-architecture>` "
"documentation for Mattermost deployment configurations based on expected "
"scale."
msgstr ""
"**OKR.BEST 배포:** 데이터 거주지 규정과 :doc:`단절 운영 </deployment-guide"
"/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment>`\\ 을 "
"지원하는 `Azure Local <https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/azure-"
"local/manage/disconnected-operations-overview>`_ 같은 로컬 인프라에서 주권적 "
"전술 협업을 위해 배포된 OKR.BEST입니다. 예상 규모를 기준으로 한 OKR.BEST 배포 "
"구성은 :doc:`참조 아키텍처 </administration-guide/scale/server-architecture>` "
"문서를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:54
msgid ""
"**Mattermost Server:** Core application server handling tactical "
"collaboration workloads, including:"
msgstr ""
"**OKR.BEST 서버:** 전술 협업 워크로드를 처리하는 핵심 애플리케이션 서버이며, "
"다음을 포함합니다:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:56
msgid ""
":doc:`Messaging Collaboration </end-user-guide/messaging-collaboration>`:"
" DDIL-ready 1:1, group messaging, and structured channel collaboration "
"with :doc:`rich integration capabilities </integrations-guide"
"/integrations-guide-index>` and :ref:`enterprise-grade search "
"<administration-guide/scale/scaling-for-enterprise:enterprise search>`."
msgstr ""
":doc:`메시지 협업 </end-user-guide/messaging-collaboration>`: :doc:`풍부한 통합 "
"기능 </integrations-guide/integrations-guide-index>` 및 :ref:`엔터프라이즈급 "
"검색 <administration-guide/scale/scaling-for-enterprise:enterprise search>`\\ "
"을 갖춘 DDIL 대비 1:1, 그룹 메시지, 구조화된 채널 협업입니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:58
msgid ""
":doc:`Workflow Automation </end-user-guide/workflow-automation>`: "
"Playbooks provide structure, monitoring and automation for repeatable "
"processes built-in to your local Mattermost deployment."
msgstr ""
":doc:`워크플로 자동화 </end-user-guide/workflow-automation>`: Playbooks는 로컬 "
"OKR.BEST 배포에 기본 내장되어 반복 가능한 프로세스에 대한 구조, 모니터링, "
"자동화를 제공합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:60
msgid ""
":doc:`Project Tracking </end-user-guide/project-task-management>`: Boards"
" enables project management capabilities built-in to your local "
"Mattermost deployment."
msgstr ""
":doc:`프로젝트 추적 </end-user-guide/project-task-management>`: Boards는 로컬 "
"OKR.BEST 배포에 기본 내장된 프로젝트 관리 기능을 제공합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:62
msgid ""
":doc:`AI Agents </administration-guide/configure/agents-admin-guide>`: AI"
" Agents run against a local LLM hosted within your tactical network."
msgstr ""
":doc:`AI 에이전트 </administration-guide/configure/agents-admin-guide>`: AI "
"에이전트는 전술 네트워크 내에 호스팅된 로컬 LLM에 대해 실행됩니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:64
msgid ""
":doc:`Audio & Screenshare </administration-guide/configure/calls-"
"deployment-guide>`: Calls offers native real-time self-hosted audio calls"
" and screen sharing within your tactical network."
msgstr ""
":doc:`오디오 및 화면 공유 </administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-"
"guide>`: Calls는 전술 네트워크 내에서 네이티브 실시간 셀프 호스팅 오디오 통화와 "
"화면 공유를 제공합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:66
msgid ""
"**Proxy Server:** The :doc:`proxy server </deployment-guide/server/setup-"
"nginx-proxy>` handles HTTP(S) routing within the cluster, directing "
"traffic between the server and clients accessing Mattermost services. "
"NGINX is recommended for load balancing with support for WebSocket "
"connections, health check endpoints, and sticky sessions. The proxy layer"
" provides SSL termination and distributes client traffic across "
"application servers."
msgstr ""
"**프록시 서버:** :doc:`프록시 서버 </deployment-guide/server/setup-nginx-"
"proxy>`\\ 는 클러스터 내 HTTP(S) 라우팅을 처리하여 OKR.BEST 서비스에 접근하는 "
"서버와 클라이언트 간의 트래픽을 전달합니다. WebSocket 연결, 상태 점검 "
"엔드포인트, 고정 세션을 지원하는 부하 분산에는 NGINX를 권장합니다. 프록시 계층은 "
"SSL 종료를 제공하고 클라이언트 트래픽을 애플리케이션 서버 전반에 분산합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:68
msgid ""
"**PostgreSQL Database:** Stores persistent application data on a "
":doc:`PostgreSQL v13+ database </deployment-guide/server/preparations>` "
"hosted locally within your tactical network."
msgstr ""
"**PostgreSQL 데이터베이스:** 전술 네트워크 내에 로컬로 호스팅된 "
":doc:`PostgreSQL v13 이상 데이터베이스 </deployment-guide/server/preparations>`"
"\\ 에 영구 애플리케이션 데이터를 저장합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:70
msgid ""
"**Object Storage:** File uploads, images, and attachments are stored "
"outside the application node on an :doc:`S3-compatible store "
"</deployment-guide/server/preparations>` or network/local storage, hosted"
" locally within your tactical network."
msgstr ""
"**오브젝트 스토리지:** 파일 업로드, 이미지, 첨부 파일은 전술 네트워크 내에 "
"로컬로 호스팅된 :doc:`S3 호환 저장소 </deployment-guide/server/preparations>` "
"또는 네트워크/로컬 저장소의 애플리케이션 노드 외부에 저장됩니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:72
msgid ""
"**Recording Instance:** ``calls-offloader`` job service, configured using"
" the :doc:`Calls Offloader Setup and Configuration </administration-"
"guide/configure/calls-offloader-setup>` guide, to offload heavy "
"processing tasks from Mattermost Calls to self-hosted infrastructure "
"within your tactical network, such as recordings, transcriptions, and "
"live captioning. *(Optional)*"
msgstr ""
"**녹화 인스턴스:** :doc:`Calls Offloader 설정 및 구성 </administration-"
"guide/configure/calls-offloader-setup>` 가이드를 사용해 구성한 ``calls-"
"offloader`` 작업 서비스로, 녹화, 전사, 실시간 자막 같은 무거운 처리 작업을 "
"OKR.BEST Calls에서 전술 네트워크 내의 셀프 호스팅 인프라로 오프로드합니다. "
"*(선택 사항)*"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:74
msgid ""
"**Self-hosted integrations:** :doc:`Custom apps, plugins, and webhooks "
"</integrations-guide/integrations-guide-index>` can be deployed within "
"your tactical network. *(Optional - not shown)*"
msgstr ""
"**셀프 호스팅 통합:** :doc:`사용자 지정 앱, 플러그인, 웹훅 </integrations-guide"
"/integrations-guide-index>`\\ 은 전술 네트워크 내에 배포할 수 있습니다. *(선택 "
"사항 - 표시되지 않음)*"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:76
msgid ""
"**Self-hosted LLM:** Locally hosted :doc:`OpenAI compatible LLM "
"</agents/docs/providers>` for agentic powered collaboration within your "
"tactical network. *(Optional)*"
msgstr ""
"**셀프 호스팅 LLM:** 전술 네트워크 내에서 에이전트 기반 협업을 위한 로컬 "
"호스팅 :doc:`OpenAI 호환 LLM </agents/docs/providers>`\\ 입니다. *(선택 "
"사항)*"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:78
msgid ""
"**Microsoft Global Network:** `World-wide network "
"<https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/networking/microsoft-global-"
"network>`_ of Microsoft data centers, delivering public cloud services "
"when internet connectivity permits."
msgstr ""
"**Microsoft 글로벌 네트워크:** 인터넷 연결이 허용될 때 퍼블릭 클라우드 서비스를 "
"제공하는 Microsoft 데이터 센터의 `전 세계 네트워크 "
"<https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/networking/microsoft-global-"
"network>`_\\ 입니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:81
msgid "Operational Best Practices"
msgstr "운영 모범 사례"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:83
msgid ""
"The following best practices and deployment configurations help ensure "
"that Mattermost remains compliant and operationally resilient in "
"contested environments."
msgstr ""
"다음 모범 사례와 배포 구성은 경쟁 환경에서 OKR.BEST가 규정을 준수하고 운영상 "
"복원력을 유지하도록 보장하는 데 도움이 됩니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:86
msgid "User Authentication"
msgstr "사용자 인증"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:88
msgid ""
"DDIL environments require authentication infrastructure that remains "
"fully operational without internet connectivity. Relying solely on cloud-"
"based identity providers like Microsoft Entra ID creates a critical "
"single point of failure when tactical networks become disconnected. To "
"ensure mission users maintain authentication capabilities, deploy a "
"locally hosted identity provider within the tactical network."
msgstr ""
"DDIL 환경에는 인터넷 연결 없이도 완전히 작동하는 인증 인프라가 필요합니다. "
"Microsoft Entra ID 같은 클라우드 기반 ID 공급자에만 의존하면 전술 네트워크가 "
"단절될 때 치명적인 단일 장애 지점이 발생합니다. 임무 사용자가 인증 역량을 "
"유지하도록 보장하려면 전술 네트워크 내에 로컬 호스팅 ID 공급자를 배포하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:90
msgid ""
"**Enterprise Users:** Access Teams and Outlook by authenticating to "
"Microsoft 365 via Entra ID, and their M365 session also provides access "
"to the embedded Mattermost experience when the tactical network is "
"internet connected."
msgstr ""
"**엔터프라이즈 사용자:** Entra ID를 통해 Microsoft 365에 인증하여 Teams와 "
"Outlook에 접근하며, 전술 네트워크가 인터넷에 연결되어 있을 때는 M365 세션을 통해 "
"내장 OKR.BEST 환경에도 접근할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:92
msgid ""
"**Mission users:** Authenticate to Mattermost using a local IdP, such as "
":doc:`Keycloak </administration-guide/onboard/sso-saml-keycloak>` (open-"
"source IdP with OIDC/SAML support), Active Directory with ADFS, or "
"OpenLDAP with an OIDC bridge. When internet connected, the local IdP can "
"optionally federate with Microsoft Entra ID to synchronize user accounts,"
" credentials, and group memberships to enable access to Microsoft "
"applications."
msgstr ""
"**임무 사용자:** :doc:`Keycloak </administration-guide/onboard/sso-saml-"
"keycloak>`(OIDC/SAML을 지원하는 오픈소스 IdP), ADFS가 적용된 Active Directory, "
"OIDC 브리지가 적용된 OpenLDAP 같은 로컬 IdP를 사용하여 OKR.BEST에 인증합니다. "
"인터넷에 연결되어 있을 때 로컬 IdP는 선택적으로 Microsoft Entra ID와 페더레이션"
"하여 사용자 계정, 자격 증명, 그룹 멤버십을 동기화함으로써 Microsoft 애플리케이션"
"에 대한 접근을 가능하게 할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:94
msgid ""
"User accounts must be provisioned in the local IdP before disconnection "
"occurs to ensure authentication services remain available throughout DDIL"
" conditions."
msgstr ""
"DDIL 조건 전반에 걸쳐 인증 서비스를 계속 사용할 수 있도록, 단절이 발생하기 전에 "
"로컬 IdP에 사용자 계정을 프로비저닝해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:97
msgid "Sovereign AI"
msgstr "주권적 AI"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:99
msgid ""
"Deploy an :doc:`OpenAI compatible LLM </administration-guide/configure"
"/agents-admin-guide>` on tactical infrastructure to ensure AI "
"capabilities remain fully sovereign and operational in disconnected "
"scenarios. A self-hosted LLM can power :ref:`message and call "
"summarization, semantic search <end-user-guide/agents:analyze threads and"
" channels>`, and :ref:`mission-tuned AI agents <administration-"
"guide/configure/agents-admin-guide:agent configuration>` without relying "
"on public cloud AI services. This guarantees compliance with strict data "
"handling mandates and enables AI-enhanced workflows to function locally, "
"even during extended disconnections."
msgstr ""
"전술 인프라에 :doc:`OpenAI 호환 LLM </administration-guide/configure/agents-"
"admin-guide>`\\ 을 배포하여 AI 기능이 단절 시나리오에서도 완전히 주권적이고 작동 "
"가능한 상태를 유지하도록 보장하세요. 셀프 호스팅 LLM은 퍼블릭 클라우드 AI "
"서비스에 의존하지 않고 :ref:`메시지 및 통화 요약, 의미 기반 검색 <end-user-"
"guide/agents:analyze threads and channels>`\\ 과 :ref:`임무 맞춤형 AI 에이전트 "
"<administration-guide/configure/agents-admin-guide:agent configuration>`\\ 를 "
"구동할 수 있습니다. 이는 엄격한 데이터 처리 의무 준수를 보장하고, 장기간의 단절 "
"중에도 AI로 강화된 워크플로가 로컬에서 작동하도록 합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:102
msgid "Self-hosted audio & screensharing"
msgstr "셀프 호스팅 오디오 및 화면 공유"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:104
msgid ""
"Effective collaboration at the tactical edge requires all voice and "
"screen sharing capabilities remain operational without reliance on the "
"internet or third-party services. Deploy :doc:`Mattermost Calls "
"</administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-guide>` in a self-"
"hosted configuration, including:"
msgstr ""
"전술 엣지에서 효과적인 협업을 하려면 모든 음성 및 화면 공유 기능이 인터넷이나 "
"서드파티 서비스에 의존하지 않고 작동해야 합니다. :doc:`OKR.BEST Calls "
"</administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-guide>`\\ 를 셀프 호스팅 "
"구성으로 배포하며, 다음을 포함합니다:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:106
msgid ""
"The ``rtcd`` service, configured using the :doc:`RTCD Setup and "
"Configuration </administration-guide/configure/calls-rtcd-setup>` guide, "
"provides scalable, low-latency media routing hosted on-premises. Run "
"multiple ``rtcd`` nodes for redundancy."
msgstr ""
":doc:`RTCD 설정 및 구성 </administration-guide/configure/calls-rtcd-setup>` "
"가이드를 사용해 구성한 ``rtcd`` 서비스는 온프레미스에 호스팅되는 확장 가능하고 "
"지연 시간이 짧은 미디어 라우팅을 제공합니다. 이중화를 위해 여러 ``rtcd`` 노드를 "
"실행하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:107
msgid ""
"The ``calls-offloader`` service, configured using the :doc:`Calls "
"Offloader Setup and Configuration </administration-guide/configure/calls-"
"offloader-setup>` guide, offloads heavy processing tasks like recording, "
"transcription and live captioning to a locally hosted compliance-approved"
" job server."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Calls Offloader 설정 및 구성 </administration-guide/configure/calls-"
"offloader-setup>` 가이드를 사용해 구성한 ``calls-offloader`` 서비스는 녹화, "
"전사, 실시간 자막 같은 무거운 처리 작업을 로컬로 호스팅된 규정 승인 작업 서버로 "
"오프로드합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:110
msgid "High availability and fault tolerance"
msgstr "고가용성 및 내결함성"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:112
msgid ""
"Deploy Mattermost in a :doc:`cluster-based architecture </administration-"
"guide/scale/high-availability-cluster-based-deployment>` to ensure "
"continued availability during outages or hardware failures. High "
"availability requires redundant infrastructure across each critical "
"component:"
msgstr ""
"장애나 하드웨어 결함 중에도 지속적인 가용성을 보장하려면 OKR.BEST를 :doc:`클러스터 "
"기반 아키텍처 </administration-guide/scale/high-availability-cluster-based-"
"deployment>`\\ 로 배포하세요. 고가용성을 위해서는 각 핵심 구성 요소에 이중화 "
"인프라가 필요합니다:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:114
msgid ""
"Application servers: Scale horizontally across multiple nodes with a load"
" balancer distributing client traffic."
msgstr ""
"애플리케이션 서버: 클라이언트 트래픽을 분산하는 부하 분산기와 함께 여러 노드에 "
"걸쳐 수평으로 확장합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:115
msgid ""
"Search service: :ref:`Elasticsearch or AWS OpenSearch Service "
"<administration-guide/scale/scaling-for-enterprise:enterprise search>` "
"provides optimized search performance with dedicated indexing for large-"
"scale deployments."
msgstr ""
"검색 서비스: :ref:`Elasticsearch 또는 AWS OpenSearch Service <administration-"
"guide/scale/scaling-for-enterprise:enterprise search>`\\ 는 대규모 배포를 위한 "
"전용 인덱싱으로 최적화된 검색 성능을 제공합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:116
msgid ""
"Object storage: Configure S3-compatible backends with erasure coding or "
"replication for durability. All application servers must access shared "
"file storage (NAS or S3) to ensure consistent data availability."
msgstr ""
"오브젝트 스토리지: 내구성을 위해 소거 코딩 또는 복제를 갖춘 S3 호환 백엔드를 "
"구성하세요. 일관된 데이터 가용성을 보장하려면 모든 애플리케이션 서버가 공유 파일 "
"저장소(NAS 또는 S3)에 접근할 수 있어야 합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:117
msgid "Calls services: Run multiple ``rtcd`` and offloader nodes for resilience."
msgstr "Calls 서비스: 복원력을 위해 여러 ``rtcd`` 및 offloader 노드를 실행합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:120
msgid "Compliance and retention"
msgstr "규정 준수 및 보존"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:122
msgid ""
"Sovereign environments often require strict enforcement of retention "
"policies, legal hold, and export controls. Configure Mattermost's built-"
"in compliance features to meet organizational mandates."
msgstr ""
"주권적 환경에서는 보존 정책, 법적 보존(legal hold), 내보내기 제어를 엄격하게 "
"시행해야 하는 경우가 많습니다. 조직의 의무를 충족하도록 OKR.BEST의 기본 내장 "
"규정 준수 기능을 구성하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:124
msgid ""
"Enable :doc:`compliance export </administration-guide/comply/compliance-"
"export>` and :doc:`monitoring </administration-guide/comply/compliance-"
"monitoring>` to produce auditable exports of message data and user "
"activity logs."
msgstr ""
"메시지 데이터와 사용자 활동 로그의 감사 가능한 내보내기를 생성하려면 :doc:`규정 "
"준수 내보내기 </administration-guide/comply/compliance-export>` 및 "
":doc:`모니터링 </administration-guide/comply/compliance-monitoring>`\\ 을 "
"활성화하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:125
msgid ""
"Configure :doc:`message retention </administration-guide/comply/data-"
"retention-policy>` and :doc:`legal hold </administration-guide/comply"
"/legal-hold>` policies to align with applicable regulations."
msgstr ""
"적용 가능한 규정에 맞도록 :doc:`메시지 보존 </administration-guide/comply/data-"
"retention-policy>` 및 :doc:`법적 보존 </administration-guide/comply/legal-"
"hold>` 정책을 구성하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations.rst:126
msgid ""
"Integrate with your organization's :doc:`eDiscovery </administration-"
"guide/comply/electronic-discovery>` and archiving systems as required."
msgstr ""
"필요에 따라 조직의 :doc:`eDiscovery </administration-guide/comply/electronic-"
"discovery>` 및 아카이빙 시스템과 통합하세요."

